From bba4eaa3da0ba7f732e3871e7a06d4c0279347bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 22:02:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] docs: replace T11 section 4 with what S8 actually turned
 out to be

The section was written expecting a gain calibration. That cannot be done --
the blend's 13 m of travel is geometric, warping only moves where the gain
sits, and a rate limit sized to the authority puts the commit out of reach
inside the episode. The factor became a ratchet instead, with the jitter
measurement, the bitwise floor re-check and the observation change recorded in
place so the lower window reads the result rather than the plan.

Regression after S8: 228 passed.

